 \n\n 3:00pm to 4:00pm\n\n Location: \n\n Online webinar\n\n About \n\n The
  Cambridge Forum for Legal & Political Philosophy will host its second 202
 6 Michaelmas Term monthly seminar on Thursday\, November 26th\, at 3:00pm\
 , through Zoom. The seminar will be chaired by Thomas Bullemore\, who is a
  DPhil candidate at Oxford University. The title of his talk is "Is Realit
 y Normatively Structured?"\n Anyone interested in legal or political philo
 sophy is welcome to attend the seminar. If you would like to receive the Z
 oom invitation\, you should please write to Professor Matthew Kramer ( mhk
 11@cam.ac.uk ). Please write from an institutional email account rather th
 an from a generic account such as gmail or hotmail.
